{"recordId":"general_盧象昇_909460246","name":"盧象昇","type":"general","dynasty":"明朝","title":"盧忠烈","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"盧象昇","pageId":216197,"revisionId":87181523,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-05-07T12:20:57Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9B%A7%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%87","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87181523","wikidataId":"Q15908981","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"文章鄕贤卢象升家书 - 台湾大陆同乡会文献数据库","url":"https://www.tongxianghuicn.com/article/1586160.jhtml?libId=","type":"citation-template","template":"Cite web","author":"","publisher":"","date":"","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"家谱分类 江苏宜兴卢氏宗谱: 十四卷：敦本堂_家谱网 - 族谱","url":"http://4g.jiapu.best198.com/g/xin_3882.html","type":"citation-template","template":"Cite web","author":"","publisher":"","date":"","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"東林列傳·盧象昇列傳","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"罪惟錄","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"明史·盧象昇列傳","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"重刊宜兴县旧志","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"河南通志","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"卢象昇疏牍","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"東林列傳","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"盧忠肅集","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"重刊宜興縣舊志·卷七","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:33:17.313Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:mingshi","source:qingshigao"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:mingshi-d2a36d3f9437c721","query":"盧象昇","count":7,"offset":4839,"excerpt":"月丙申，副將賀人龍等敗賊於藍田。\n\n　　六月辛未，總督侍郎陳奇瑜、鄖陽撫治都御史盧象昇會師於上津，剿湖廣賊。甲戌，河決沛縣。是夏，官軍圍高迎祥、李自成諸賊於興安之車箱峽兩月。賊食盡，偽降。陳奇瑜受之，縱出險。復叛，陷所過州縣。張應昌自清水追賊，敗","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-3393d5c12a953ce8","query":"盧象昇","count":5,"offset":510,"excerpt":"大清兵入牆子嶺，總督薊遼兵部侍郎吳阿衡死之。癸未，京師戒嚴。\n\n　　冬十月癸巳，盧象昇入援，召對於武英殿。甲午，括馬。盧象昇、高起潛分督援軍。是月，洪承疇、曹變蛟大破賊於潼關南原，李自成以數騎遁。\n\n　　十一月戊辰，大清兵克高陽，致仕大學士孫承宗","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-c17de1a9aff03dc6","query":"盧象昇","count":1,"offset":4763,"excerpt":"崇禎十六年設。\n\n　　總理南直隸、河南、山東、湖廣、四川軍務一員。崇禎八年設，以盧象昇為之，與總督或分或並。\n\n　　總理河漕兼提督軍務一員。永樂九年遣尚書治河，自後間遣侍郎、都御史。成化後，始稱總督河道。正德四年，定設都御史。嘉靖二十年，以都御史","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-287c555495f747c3","query":"盧象昇","count":1,"offset":3603,"excerpt":"潁州。九月中，追蝎子塊於沈邱瓦店，戰敗被執，賊挾之攻蘄、黃。全昌因代賊求撫，總理盧象昇不許，責全昌喪師辱國，曰「賊果欲降，可滅其黨示信」。賊不聽命。久之，全昌脫歸，謁象昇陽和。象昇令募兵山、陝。尋薦之朝，令赴軍前立功，帝不許。十年四月，以楊嗣昌言","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-2f65b2289890b17d","query":"盧象昇","count":3,"offset":2979,"excerpt":"漆坪，渡河犯商南。奇瑜乃馳至均州，檄四巡撫會討。陜西練國事駐商南，遏其西北；鄖陽盧象昇駐房、竹，遏其西；河南元默駐盧氏，遏其東北；湖廣唐暉駐南漳，遏其東南。奇瑜乃偕象昇督將士由竹溪至平利之烏林關，十餘戰，斬賊千七百餘級。越七日，大破之乜家溝，斬千","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-967c3356fa11f488","query":"盧象昇","count":4,"offset":20,"excerpt":"〔篇題：卷二百六十一\n列傳第一百四十九　盧象昇 劉之綸 丘民仰〕\n\n○盧象昇〔（弟象晉象觀從弟象同）〕劉之綸邱民仰〔（邱禾嘉）〕\n\n盧象昇，字建鬥，宜興人。祖立誌，儀封知縣。象昇白皙而臞，膊獨骨，負殊力。舉","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-82fc35d8d3d030d6","query":"盧象昇","count":1,"offset":1333,"excerpt":"鳳陽。時江北州縣多陷。明年正月，賊圍滁州，連營百餘里，總兵祖寬大破之。大典會總理盧象昇追襲，復破之。急還兵遏賊眾於鳳陽，賊始退。十一年，賊復入江北，謀竄茶山。大典與安慶巡撫史可法提兵遏之，賊乃西遁。大典先坐失州縣，貶秩視事。是年四月以平賊逾期，再","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-61b13202c55d4234","query":"盧象昇","count":1,"offset":15671,"excerpt":"用軍禮。永平道劉景耀、關內道楊於國疏爭，被黜。既而與兵部尚書楊嗣昌比，致宣大總督盧象昇孤軍戰歿，又匿不言狀，人多疾之。\n\n十七年，李自成將犯闕，帝復命起潛監寧、前諸軍，而以杜勛鎮宣府。勛至鎮即降賊。事聞，廷臣請急撤城守太監，忽傳旨云：「杜勛罵賊殉","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-9261555178b33808","query":"盧象昇","count":1,"offset":6673,"excerpt":"，復至山東，攻濟南府破之，蹂躪數千里，明兵望風披靡，克府一州三縣五十七，總督宣大盧象昇戰死，擒德王硃由賸、郡王硃慈漻、奉國將軍硃慈黨、總督太監馮允升等，俘獲人口五十餘萬，他物稱是。是役也，揚武大將軍貝勒岳託、輔國公瑪瞻卒于軍。上聞震悼，輟飲食三日","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":9,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:mingshi-d2a36d3f9437c721","bookId":"book:mingshi","requestedTitle":"明史/卷23","title":"明史/卷23","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B723","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594639","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B723?action=history","revisionId":2594639,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-08-30T13:22:11Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:58:10.669Z","sha256":"45f300d41c2940bc0fe5e30884e4a812763053b8bc3e5af5eb2654ea0918ca17","textSha256":"3db2d6b1bdb3738a6e6266fdebfea5f1223cf86e676eb9d6edbf831a4ac3b0b1","expandedWikitextSha256":"45f300d41c2940bc0fe5e30884e4a812763053b8bc3e5af5eb2654ea0918ca17","characters":7795,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:44.951Z","upstreamTextQuality":50,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-co